          </p>
          <p>
            The available CSM grades are identified by area weight: CSM 300 is 300 g/m² and CSM 450 is 450 g/m². Neither weight is a universal answer for every component. Use the part drawing, laminate design, reinforcement build-up, resin system and production method to discuss the appropriate requirement before purchase.
          </p>
