        {isIsoFireRetardantResin && <p class="fire-retardant-enquiry-note">Share the finished FRP component, whether an isophthalic or halogen-free FR grade is specified, the exact fire standard or classification if one is named, required documentation, service environment where relevant, quantity, packaging requirement and delivery location. This supports a focused product discussion without implying a finished-system approval.</p>}
