        {isMarbleResin && <p class="upr-buyer-intro">Share the finished marble, artificial-stone, quartz, onyx or other stone-composite product; the current TDS or catalogue reference being evaluated; required appearance or finish; any written technical requirement; expected quantity; packaging need; delivery location; and documentation required. This supports a grade discussion without implying a formulation, finished-product approval or chemical-compatibility recommendation.</p>}
        {isVinylEsterResin && <p class="upr-buyer-intro">Share the finished FRP component, exact grade if known, service medium and concentration where relevant, operating temperature where relevant, any stated fire or technical requirement, expected quantity, packaging need, delivery location and required documentation. This supports grade selection without implying chemical compatibility or finished-system approval.</p>}
        {isBisphenolResin && <p class="upr-buyer-intro">Share the intended finished application, the exact TDS or catalogue reference being evaluated, any stated chemistry or technical requirement, expected quantity, packaging need, delivery location and required documentation. Where a service environment matters, include the medium, concentration and temperature where relevant; this supports product selection without implying chemical compatibility, a formulation or finished-system approval.</p>}
        {isFiberglassEpoxyResin && <p class="upr-buyer-intro">Share the finished fiberglass or composite component, whether resin only or a complete system is required, the current TDS or catalogue reference, reinforcement form if known, relevant listed process context, required published data or documentation, quantity, packaging need and delivery location. The current documents do not name a confirmed compatible hardener, prescribe a laminate design or establish finished-component approval.</p>}
