    /* Every "Enquire / Discuss your requirement" CTA on this page — and
       there are dozens, per-product — jumps here via #enquire. Without a
       scroll-margin, the sticky 68px header landed directly on top of the
       section heading on arrival; matching the same scroll-margin-top
       already used for .cat-block/.article-section/.gp-case-study lands it
       cleanly below the header instead, same as any other in-page jump. */
    .enquire-sec { position: relative; scroll-margin-top: 90px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--bg-2) 64px); }
    .enquire-sec::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 1px;
